    <div class="article-content">
      <p>{{ config.siteName }} ("we", "our", or "us") takes your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your personal information.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>1.1 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p>When you visit our website, we may automatically collect the following information through cookies and analytics tools:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Including your IP address, browser type and version, operating system, device type, etc.</li>
        <li><strong>Browsing Information:</strong> Including pages visited, visit time, duration, click paths, referral pages, etc.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookie Data:</strong> We use cookies and analytics tools (e.g., Google Analytics) to understand website usage.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>1.2 Information You Provide</h3>
      <p>This website is a content-only static site. <strong>We do not collect any personal data through forms or interactions.</strong> If you contact us via email, we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email address (from your message)</li>
        <li>Message content sent to us directly</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Service Improvement:</strong> Understand content usage patterns and optimize user experience.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Use anonymized traffic data to understand website performance.</li>
        <li><strong>Communication:</strong> If you contact us, we respond to your inquiries.</li>
        <li><strong>Security:</strong> Detect and handle abnormal traffic to ensure website security.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Data Storage & Security</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>This website is deployed on <strong>Cloudflare</strong> global CDN with Cloudflare's security protections.</li>
        <li>This is a static content site. <strong>No user input data is collected or processed.</strong></li>
        <li>Analytics data (e.g., Google Analytics) is stored in anonymized form. We do not link analytics with personally identifiable information.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Use of Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use the following types of cookies:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> For tracking website traffic and usage (e.g., Google Analytics).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can manage or delete cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect some features.</p>

      <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We may use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> For website traffic analysis. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> (if enabled) For displaying ads. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Policies</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Under applicable privacy laws, you may have the following rights:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Access:</strong> Learn about the personal information we hold about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate personal information.</li>
        <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your personal information.</li>
        <li><strong>Withdraw Consent:</strong> Withdraw previously given consent.</li>
        <li><strong>Unsubscribe:</strong> Use the unsubscribe link at the bottom of emails.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>This website is not directed to children under 13. We do not intentionally collect personal information from children. If we discover we have collected such information, we will delete it promptly.</p>

      <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updated policies will be posted on this page with the last updated date at the top. We encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>

      <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:hello@seo-hub.pages.dev">hello@seo-hub.pages.dev</a></p>
